Subject: [PATCH] Add the gift crate, the pet crate wrapped as a present (#859)

CleanACat_Prop_GiftCrate: pink frame, cream slats, a gold ribbon down both sides and across the lid, and a
gold bow where the pet crate has ears. Same size, pivot, lid hinge, Attachments (PetSeat, Burst, Odds),
attributes (LidOpenDegrees, CatScale) and Atomic streaming as the pet crate. The pet crate is unchanged.

